      "policy_quote": "Before taking any action that updates the database (cancel, modify, return, exchange), you must list the action details and obtain explicit user confirmation (yes) to proceed.",
      "requirement": "The assistant must explicitly confirm with the user the details of the action (e.g., items to be modified, payment method for refund) before proceeding with any database update."
