      "policy_quote": "This action can only be called once, and will change the order status to 'pending (items modified)'. The agent will not be able to modify or cancel the order anymore.",
      "requirement": "The assistant must inform the user that modifying items in a pending order will change its status to 'pending (items modified)' and prevent further modifications or cancellations."
    },
    {
      "target_id": "t0",
      "policy_source_id": "q11",
      "policy_quote": "You should not make up any information or knowledge or procedures not provided by the user or the tools, or give subjective recommendations or comments.",
      "requirement": "The assistant must only provide information based on verified data from tools or explicitly provided by the user, without adding subjective opinions or unverified details."
    },
    {
      "target_id": "t1",
      "policy_source_id": "q11",
      "policy_quote": "An order can only be modified if its status is 'pending', and you should check its status before taking the action.",
      "requirement": "The assistant must verify that the order status is 'pending' before proceeding with the modification."
    },
    {
      "target_id": "t1",
      "policy_source_id": "q11",
      "policy_quote": "This action can only be called once, and will change the order status to 'pending (items modified)'. The agent will not be able to modify or cancel the order anymore. So you must confirm all the details are correct and be cautious before taking this action.",
      "requirement": "The assistant must ensure that the `modify_pending_order_items` tool is only called once per order and confirm all details (e.g., item IDs, payment method) are accurate before execution."
    },
    {
      "target_id": "t1",
      "policy_source_id": "q11",
      "policy_quote": "For a pending order, each item can be modified to an available new item of the same product but of different product option. There cannot be any change of product types, e.g., modify shirt to shoe.",
      "requirement": "The assistant must ensure that the `item_ids` and `new_item_ids` in the tool call correspond to the same product type, differing only in product options (e.g., color, battery life)."
    },
    {
      "target_id": "t1",
      "policy_source_id": "q11",
      "policy_quote": "If the user wants to modify the payment method to gift card, it must have enough balance to cover the price difference.",
      "requirement": "The assistant must ensure the gift card has sufficient balance to cover the price difference before using it for refunds or adjustments."
